[node name="Fridge" type="Node3D"]
metadata/_doc = "Tall single-door fridge (fable-high), cabinet 0.60 x 0.65 x 1.85 m. Origin = bottom center of the cabinet, front faces +Z, hinge on the left (-X) edge. Grab the handle to open (0..92 degrees); released near closed, the seal pulls it shut. Interior light while open, cans stand on the shelves."

